# Rendered voiceover (~184 MB, 7,983 files). Generated, not authored: the
# script is tool/export_tts_vo.py and the source of truth for *what is said* is
# content/production/audio/audio_manifest.csv, which IS tracked. Re-render with
#   cd apps/mobile && python tool/export_tts_vo.py --all
# Keeping the blobs out of history is what lets this repo live inside OneDrive.
# apps/mobile/tool/MEDIA_README.md documents the backup location.
apps/mobile/assets/audio/en/
apps/mobile/assets/audio/fr/
apps/mobile/assets/audio/sw/

